 remote - carry AMREF evac + insurance","fcdo":{"posture":"AREA-RESTRICTED","quotes":[],"url":"https://www.gov.uk/foreign-travel-advice/tanzania","read":"2026-08-20T14:54:17Z","page_updated":"2026-05-19T15:47:49+01:00","source_country":"tanzania","quotes_note":"not extracted by the join — a restricted-area clause is quoted by a human, never composed"}},"timing":{"peak":"Jul-Oct (dry + Mara River crossings, Aug-Sep drama); secondary Jan-Feb (Ndutu calving)","shoulder":"Jun (Grumeti crossings, less crowded) + Nov (short rains, herds moving south)","green":"Mar-May (long rains - lush, quiet, cheapest; some camps close)","booking_lead":"6-12 mo for Jul-Sep peak + calving (premium/mobile camps sell out); mid-range 3-6 mo; green 1-3 mo","off_season_specials":"Mar-May green-season value + Grumeti-crossing (Jun) shoulder; combine Ngorongoro/Tarangire","event_peaks":"Jul-Sep Mara-crossing crush + Jan-Feb calving; Christmas/NY + Easter; N-Hemisphere summer","fire_date":"Jul-Sep crossings 9-12 mo out (by prior Oct-Dec); Jan-Feb calving by prior Apr-Jun; green-season value by prior Nov-Dec"},"jewels":[{"name":"The Great Migration - Mara River crossings","si_tag":"safari","status":"live","tier":"premier","price_band":"~$1,200-2,700+/pp/day","timing":"Jul-Oct; book 9-12 mo","draw_rank":1,"hook":"the planet''s greatest overland migration at its most dramatic — herds massing and plunging past waiting crocodiles in the northern Serengeti, Jul–Oct, peak Aug–Sep","si":"safari","blurb":"the planet''s greatest overland migration at its most dramatic — herds massing and plunging past waiting crocodiles in the northern Serengeti, Jul–Oct, peak Aug–Sep","when":"Jul-Oct; book 9-12 mo","commission":"safari DMC 10-20%","wells":["move"],"wells_basis":"pass 2 — text","si_all":["safari"],"shelf_fit":{"adventure":"destination","culture":"destination","romance":"destination","safari":"primary","ultra":"destination"},"commission_pct_low":10,"commission_pct_high":20,"commission_lane":["DMC"],"commis