"when_source":"derived from destination timing","timing_type":"SEASONAL-WINDOW","hook":"the Serengeti on foot — tracks, dung, birdsong and the adrenaline of dangerous-game country with an armed ranger","si":"adventure","blurb":"the Serengeti on foot — tracks, dung, birdsong and the adrenaline of dangerous-game country with an armed ranger","when":"Jul-Oct","commission":"camp/DMC","wells":["activities"],"wells_basis":"derived from name/blurb/hook","si_all":["adventure","safari"],"shelf_fit":{"adventure":"primary","culture":"destination","romance":"destination","safari":"evidenced","ultra":"destination"},"commission_lane":["DMC"],"commission_embedded":false,"commission_basis":"lane"},{"name":"A migration-following luxury mobile camp","si_tag":"ultra","status":"live","tier":"luxury","price_band":"~$1,500-4,000+/night all-in","timing":"standing; peak 9-12 mo","draw_rank":1,"hook":"the ultra way to do the migration — Singita, &Beyond, Nomad and Namiri Plains move their tented camps to the herds","si":"ultra","blurb":"the ultra way to do the migration — Singita, &Beyond, Nomad and Namiri Plains move their tented camps to the herds","when":"standing; peak 9-12 mo","commission":"consortia/Virtuoso + DMC","wells":["stay"],"wells_basis":"derived from name/blurb/hook","si_all":["safari","ultra"],"shelf_fit":{"adventure":"destination","culture":"destination","romance":"destination","safari":"evidenced","ultra":"primary"},"commission_lane":["DMC","consortia"],"commission_embedded":false,"commission_basis":"lane"},{"name":"Honeymoon safari - star bed + bush dinner","si_tag":"romance","status":"live","tier":"luxury","price_band":"on application","timing":"Jul-Oct","draw_rank":1,"when_source":"derived from destination timing","timing_type":"SEASONAL-WINDOW","hook":"sundowners on the plains, a private bush dinner under the lanterns, a sleep-out under the Milky Way — the romance of the wild","si":"romance","blurb":"sundowners on the plains, a private bush dinner under the lanterns, a sleep-out under the Milky Way — the romance of the wild","when":"Jul-Oct","commission":"consortia/host","wells":["stay","eat","activities"],"wells_basis":"derived from name/blurb/hook","si_all":["romance","safari"],"shelf_fit":{"adventure":"destination","culture":"destination","romance":"primary","safari":"evidenced","ultra":"destination"},"commission_lane":["consortia"],"commission_embedded":false,"commission_basis":"lane"},{"name":"A Maasai cultural visit","si_tag":"culture","status":"future","tier":"essential","price_band":"~$20-60/pp","timing":"Jul-Oct","draw_rank":1,"when_source":"derived from destination timing","timing_type":"SEASONAL-WINDOW","hook":"the pastoralist Maasai of the Serengeti–Ngorongoro edge — a visit to a boma, the dances and the beadwork, done with a respectful, fair-trade operator","si":"culture","blurb":"the pastoralist Maasai of the Serengeti–Ngorongoro edge — a visit to a boma, the dances and the beadwork, done with a respectful, fair-trade operator","when":"Jul-Oct","commission":"DMC/community","wells":["activities"],"wells_basis":"pass 2 — text","si_all":["culture"],"shelf_fit":{"adventure":"destination","culture":"primary","romance":"destination","safari":"destination","ultra":"destination"},"commission_lane":["DMC"],"commission_embedded":false,"commission_basis":"lane"}],"faq":[{"q":"What''s the real risk to plan for on a Serengeti safari?","a":"Not the parks - remoteness and wildlife discipline. Big game is genuinely dangerous: stay in the vehicle except in designated areas and follow your guide. The Serengeti is remote, so pair travel-medical insurance with AMREF Flying Doctors (~$40 pp/30 days) for bush-airstrip evacuation. City petty crime, not park danger, is the everyday risk.","source":"flydoc.org","si_tag":"safety"},{"q":"Should LGBTQ+ travelers be aware of anything in Tanzania?","a":"Yes, plainly: Tanzanian law criminalizes same-sex relations and the US advisory specifically flags targeting of LGBTQ+ travelers. It''s a real safety consideration to weigh; discretion is advised, and we''ll talk it through candidly before you book.","source":"newsweek.com","si_tag":"safety"},{"q":"When is the best time to see the Great Migration?","a":"General game-viewing is best in the dry season (late Jun-Oct). For the Mara River crossings, come Jul-Oct (peak Aug-Sep); for calving and big-cat drama, come Jan-Feb to the southern Ndutu plains. September is the best all-round balance of action and lighter crowds.","source":"dumaexplorer.com","si_tag":"safari"},{"q":"How many days do I need and what does a Serengeti safari cost?","a":"Plan 3-5 days (often combined with Ngorongoro/Tarangire). All-in cost runs roughly $600-1,000/day budget, $1,200-1,500 mid-range, $1,400-2,700+ luxury per person; book 6-12 months ahead for the Jul-Sep peak - premium camps sell out.","source":"bucketlistly.blog","si_tag":"safari"},{"q":"Do I need a visa or yellow-fever certificate for the Serengeti?","a":"A visa (eVisa) - apply on the official Tanzania portal before departure (~2-10 days). Yellow fever isn''t required arriving directly from the US/Europe, but becomes mandatory if you transit >12h through a risk country like Kenya - key for Kenya-Tanzania combos.","source":"tanzania-specialist.com","si_tag":"safari"}],"seo":{"meta_description":"Plan a Serengeti safari - the Great Migration (~2M wildebeest), the Mara River crossings (Jul-Oct) and Ndutu calving (Jan-Feb), the highest big-cat density on Earth, dawn balloon flights and luxury migration camps - with real timing, cost, the FCDO advisory, malaria and evac intel.","slug":"serengeti-tanzania","primary_keyword":"Serengeti safari","long_tail":["Great Migration Serengeti 2026","Mara River crossings best time","Ndutu calving season","Serengeti balloon safari","is the Serengeti safe","Serengeti safari cost","best time to visit Serengeti"],"search_language":"sw","local_keywords":["Serengeti","Uhamiaji Mkubwa","Mto Mara","Ndutu","pundamilia","nyumbu","simba","safari ya puto"],"hreflang":["en","sw"],"jsonld_type":"TouristDestination","content_freshness":"2026-07-31","attribution":{"author":{"type":"Organization","name":"TravelWell.World"},"publisher":{"type":"Organization","name":"TravelWell.World LLC"},"reviewed_by":{"type":"Organization","name":"TravelWell.World"},"digital_source_type":"CompositeWithTrainedAlgorithmicMediaDigitalSource","digital_source_vocab":"https://schema.org/IPTCDigitalSourceEnumeration","last_verified":"2026-07-31","last_verified_basis":"source_verified","verified_against":[{"name":"UK Foreign, Commonwealth & Development Office","url":"https://www.gov.uk/foreign-travel-advice/tanzania","read":"2026-08-20T14:54:17Z","source_updated":"2026-05-19T15:47:49+01:00"}]}},"booking":{"codes":["reconsider-travel","terrorism-mtwara","crime","lgbtq-targeting"],"book_suppressed":false,"note":"Serengeti safaris run with licensed operators. LGBTQ+ travelers: same-sex relations criminalized + advisory flags targeting - surface plainly. Re-verify each publish cycle.","advisory_updated":"2026-08-20","advisory_authority":"FCDO"},"si_checklist_25":{"run_date":"2026-07-31","hits":7,"misses":15,"disregarded":3,"note":"Canonical 25-SI list; SAFARI is the launch/demo SI - the park is primary safari (not globaladv); globaladv carries the balloon/walking add-ons; sports limited to participant; spectator/prosports/compsports disregarded"},"sis_present":[{"si":"safari","name":"safari","status":"live"},{"si":"ultra","name":"ultra","status":"live"},{"si":"romance","name":"Romance, Marriages & Honeymoons","status":"live"},{"si":"globaladv","name":"adventure","status":"live","note":"balloon + walking safari add-ons"},{"si":"culture","name":"culture","status":"future","note":"Maasai"}],"ultra":[{"name":"Singita Grumeti / Namiri Plains - apex Serengeti stay","why_ultra":"private-concession luxury, exclusive game, butlered tented suites - the migration to yourself","earning":"consortia/Virtuoso","virtuoso_value_add":true,"mor":"commissionable-rack","tier":"ultra","price_band":"~$2,000-4,000+/night"},{"name":"A private migration mobile camp + private guide + balloon","why_ultra":"exclusive-use mobile camp that moves with the herds, private vehicle/guide + the dawn balloon","earning":"DMC/consortia","virtuoso_value_add":false,"mor":"commissionable","tier":"ultra","price_band":"on application"},{"name":"A Northern-Circuit private-guided week (Serengeti + Ngorongoro + Tarangire)","why_ultra":"private guide + vehicle across the marquee parks, luxury camps throughout","earning":"DMC/consortia","virtuoso_value_add":false,"mor":"commissionable","tier":"ultra","price_band":"on application"}],"source_verified":"2026-07-31","hero":{"query":"Serengeti National Park, Tanzania"},"geo":{"lat":-2.3333,"lng":34.8333},"orbit":[],"orbit_country":["lake-manyara-tanzania","ngorongoro-crater-tanzania","nyerere-selous-tanzania","ruaha-tanzania","tarangire-tanzania"]}'::jsonb, 1),
  ('volcanoes-national-park-rwanda', '05A', 'Volcanoes National Park', 'Rwanda', 'Gorillas in the mist', 'live', 'verified', 'safariGiraffe', 'Rwanda — Volcanoes / Virunga', '{"safari","adventure","ultra","romance","deepdive"}', '{}', '{"essential","comfort","premier","luxury","ultra"}', null, 'anchor', '{"key_facts":["Rwanda''s flagship mountain-gorilla trek (the wow) in the Virunga volcanoes - a one-hour habituated-family encounter; world mountain-gorilla population now 1,063 (no longer critically endangered); the birthplace of African conservation (Dian Fossey/Karisoke 1967)","Permit $1,500/trekker (RDB), only 98/day, sells out - book 3-6 months ahead via a licensed operator or RDB (Irembo); min age 15; ~2h from Kigali - the accessible, premium gorilla trek","Also: golden-monkey trekking (bamboo), Mount Bisoke crater-lake hike (3,711m, most popular), Karisimbi summit (4,507m, Rwanda''s highest, 2-day), Dian Fossey grave hike, Kwita Izina gorilla-naming (Sep)","was) - bookable disclose+consent","gorilla trek = strenuous high-altitude (~2,500-3,700m) muddy rainforest hike (moderate fitness); trekking rules: 7m distance, mask, max 1hr, max 8/group, armed ranger, no trekking if ill","Sold via Rwandan safari DMCs 10-20% - IATAN/host-gated, CLIA has NO Africa representation; the $1,500 RDB permit is non-commissionable pass-through; RWF (~1,467/USD); visa on arrival $30; malaria year-round (prophylaxis); AMREF for evac"],"safety":{"emergency":"112 (police) / 912 ambulance / 111 fire; AMREF Flying Doctors for high-terrain evac","hospital":"Remote/high terrain - AMREF Flying Doctors (~$40 pp/30d) + travel-medical insurance; nearest referral Musanze/Kigali","malaria":"present year-round (chloroquine-resistant) - prophylaxis advised; DEET at dusk (lower at altitude but real)","yellow_fever":"required only if arriving from a YF-endemic country (not direct from the US)","activity_note":"Gorilla trek = strenuous high-altitude (~2,500-3,700m) muddy hike (moderate fitness); rules: 7m/1hr/mask/max 8/armed ranger/no trekking if ill. Volcano climbs = altitude sickness risk. Remote - carry AMREF evac + insurance","fcdo":{"posture":"AREA-RESTRICTED","quotes":[],"url":"https://www.gov.uk/foreign-travel-advice/rwanda","read":"2026-08-20T14:53:58Z","page_updated":"2026-06-10T15:14:19+01:00","source_country":"rwanda","quotes_note":"not extracted by the join — a restricted-area clause is quoted by a human, never composed"},"fcdo_zones":[{"name":"Within ~10 km of the DRC border","lvl":4,"except":["Volcanoes National Park"],"note":"Unrest. Multiple armed groups, individuals and military forces operate in North and South Kivu; violence may spill into Rwanda without warning. US government employees need special authorisation to travel here. State states Volcanoes National Park is not included in this area."}],"fcdo_zones_provenance":{"file":"src/data/safety.json","ref":"f8666636bc25790e0c9643ad5656f8d9fea37bf6","ref_committed":"2026-08-30T05:44:55Z","country_iso2":"RW","summary":"Some areas carry increased risk — the DRC border zone below is Do Not Travel.","source":"Curated baseline — the previous source is retired; pending re-verification against the UK FCDO","_rule":"the FCDO restricted-area records for this country, verbatim. PRESENCE OF THIS BLOCK IS NOT A CLAIM THAT THIS DESTINATION SITS IN ANY OF THEM — membership is a coverage judgement and is set only in `zone_record`, by a human."}},"timing":{"peak":"Jun-Sep + Dec-Feb (drier, firmer trails; permits sell out; Kwita Izina Sep spikes demand)","shoulder":"early Mar + late Nov (softer)","green":"Mar-May + Oct-Nov (rains - lush, muddier; 30% low-season permit discount Nov-May IF you also pre-book Akagera and/or Nyungwe nights)","booking_lead":"permits + luxury lodges 3-6 mo (Jun-Sep + Dec-Feb sell out; only 98 permits/day); green 1-3 mo","off_season_specials":"the Nov-May 30%-off permit (with Akagera/Nyungwe nights) - sell a 3-park Rwanda circuit to unlock it","event_peaks":"Kwita Izina (Sep) + Christmas/NY + Jun-Sep dry","fire_date":"Jun-Sep + Dec-Feb 6-9 mo out; Nov-May discounted 3-park circuit by prior Aug-Sep"},"jewels":[{"name":"The mountain-gorilla trek","si_tag":"safari","status":"live","tier":"premier","price_band":"~$1,000-3,000+/pp/day (permit-inclusive)","timing":"year-round; Jun-Sep + Dec-Feb peak; book 3-6 mo","draw_rank":1,"hook":"the single most moving hour in wildlife travel","si":"safari","blurb":"the single most moving hour in wildlife travel","when":"year-round; Jun-Sep + Dec-Feb peak; book 3-6 mo","commission":"DMC 10-20% (permit pass-through)","wells":["activities"],"wells_basis":"derived from name/blurb/hook","si_all":["safari"],"shelf_fit":{"adventure":"destination","deepdive":"destination","romance":"destination","safari":"primary","ultra":"destination"},"commission_pct_low":10,"commission_pct_high":20,"commission_lane":["DMC"],"commission_embedded":false,"commission_basis":"band+lane"},{"name":"Kwita Izina - the gorilla-naming ceremony","si_tag":"safari","status":"live","tier":"premier","price_band":"event + trek","timing":"September","draw_rank":2,"hook":"Rwanda''s global conservation celebration each September — newborn gorillas named before thousands; a rare, meaningful event to time a trip around","si":"safari","blurb":"Rwanda''s global conservation celebration each September — newborn gorillas named before thousands; a rare, meaningful event to time a trip around","when":"September","commission":"DMC + event","wells":[],"wells_basis":"text supports no Well — needs a human read","si_all":["safari"],"shelf_fit":{"adventure":"destination","deepdive":"destination","romance":"destination","safari":"primary","ultra":"destination"},"commission_lane":["DMC","event"],"commission_embedded":false,"commission_basis":"lane"},{"name":"Golden-monkey trekking","si_tag":"globaladv","status":"live","tier":"premier","price_band":"~$100/pp","timing":"Jun-Sep + Dec-Feb","draw_rank":1,"when_source":"derived from destination timing","timing_type":"SEAS