ivated due to the outbreak. NOTE THE FCDO ADVISES AGAINST NO TRAVEL TO UGANDA - posture 1 - so any book-suppression here is OUR health judgement, not an advisory one, and is DAVID''S CALL - CONTENT-ONLY, Book suppressed, no waiver, redirect to Rwanda''s Nyungwe. DYNAMIC - re-verify each cycle. Chimp-trek + malaria hazards secondary and moot while held. When reopened: chimp-trek rules ~8m/mask/1hr/ranger/no-trek-if-ill; warm humid forest walk (moderate)","booking_hold":false,"fcdo":{"posture":"1","quotes":[],"url":"https://www.gov.uk/foreign-travel-advice/uganda","read":"2026-08-20T14:48:47Z","page_updated":"2026-07-27T15:00:28+01:00","source_country":"uganda","quotes_note":"posture re-joined 2026-08-30 from handoff/fcdo-advisories/uganda.json, which was corrected 2026-08-23. The previous AREA-RESTRICTED was derived from prose about a NEIGHBOURING country.","posture_basis":"alert_status empty; quoted sentences name another country","posture_corrected":"2026-08-23 - was AREA-RESTRICTED, derived from prose about a neighbour"},"posture":"book-freely"},"timing":{"latent_peak":"Jun-Sep + Dec-Feb (drier, firmer forest trails; permits scarce) - IF cleared","latent_green":"Mar-May + Oct-Nov (rains, muddier; chimps lower/closer with fruiting)","latent_booking_lead":"permits + lodges 2-4 mo peak - NOT applicable while held","reverify_trigger":"check Uganda''s advisory EVERY publish cycle - DYNAMIC health advisory; flip to live the moment it drops below"},"jewels":[{"name":"Chimpanzee trekking in the primate capital","si_tag":"globaladv","status":"held","tier":"premier","price_band":"HELD ($250 permit latent)","timing":"HELD; latent Jun-Sep + Dec-Feb","draw_rank":null,"hook":"the finest chimp trek in Africa — up to 1,500 chimps in a lush rainforest","si":"adventure","blurb":"the finest chimp trek in Africa — up to 1,500 chimps in a lush rainforest","when":"HELD; latent Jun-Sep + Dec-Feb","commission":"none (advisory hold)","wells":["activities"],"wells_basis":"derived from name