  ('laikipia-kenya', '05A', 'Laikipia Plateau', 'Kenya', 'Kenya''s conservancy country', 'live', 'verified', 'lion', 'Kenya — Laikipia Plateau', '{"safari","ultra","adventure","romance","deepdive"}', '{}', '{"essential","comfort","premier","luxury","ultra"}', null, 'anchor', '{"key_facts":["Kenya''s private-conservancy heartland (Ol Pejeta, Lewa, Borana, Loisaba, Solio) - low-density, exclusive; the LAST TWO northern white rhinos on Earth (Najin + Fatu, Ol Pejeta, on-site IVF programme)","Ol Pejeta (90,000 acres) = largest black-rhino population in East Africa + Sweetwaters Chimpanzee Sanctuary (only chimps in Kenya); Lewa (UNESCO 2013) = ~12% of Kenya''s black rhino + largest Grevy''s zebra population","Do-more safari on private land: horseback safaris, walking safaris (armed guide), night drives, lion tracking, mountain biking, camel treks, star beds - all banned in the national parks","best Jul-Oct + Dec-Mar but rewarding year-round - the anchor when migration parks peak-price","Sold via Kenya safari DMCs at a FAVOURABLE 15-22% - IATAN/host-gated, CLIA has NO Africa representation; conservancy/conservation fees non-commissionable pass-through","KES (~129/USD) + M-Pesa but safari quoted USD; eTA required; malaria lower at ~1,800m but present (prophylaxis advised); YF only if arriving from a risk country; AMREF for the on-foot/horse activities"],"safety":{"emergency":"999 / 112 (limited in remote areas); Kenya Red Cross ambulance 1199; AMREF Flying Doctors for bush evac","hospital":"Remote plateau - AMREF Flying Doctors (~$40 pp/30d, air evac) + travel-medical insurance; nearest referral Nanyuki/Nairobi","malaria":"lower at ~1,800m but present - prophylaxis advised (chloroquine-resistant); DEET at dusk","yellow_fever":"compulsory only if arriving from a risk country; CDC recommends for most","activity_note":"Signature on-foot/on-horse/night safaris among dangerous game - armed conservancy guides only, higher-risk than a vehicle, follow instruction. Remote - carry A