:"essential","price_band":"~$30-120/pp","timing":"Jun-Oct + Jan-Feb","draw_rank":1,"when_source":"derived from destination timing","timing_type":"SEASONAL-WINDOW","hook":"crystal Chyulu-fed pools alive with hippos and crocodiles, watched from a famous underwater observation chamber","si":"adventure","blurb":"crystal Chyulu-fed pools alive with hippos and crocodiles, watched from a famous underwater observation chamber","when":"Jun-Oct + Jan-Feb","commission":"DMC/camp","wells":[],"wells_basis":"text supports no Well — needs a human read","si_all":["adventure"],"shelf_fit":{"adventure":"primary","deepdive":"destination","romance":"destination","safari":"destination","ultra":"destination"},"commission_lane":["DMC"],"commission_embedded":false,"commission_basis":"lane"},{"name":"The Man-Eaters of Tsavo","si_tag":"deepdive","status":"future","tier":"essential","price_band":"on application","timing":"Jun-Oct + Jan-Feb","draw_rank":1,"when_source":"derived from destination timing","timing_type":"SEASONAL-WINDOW","hook":"The 1898 lions that halted the Kenya–Uganda railway before Lt-Col Patterson shot them — Tsavo lies on the historic Nairobi–Mombasa route","si":"deepdive","blurb":"The 1898 lions that halted the Kenya–Uganda railway before Lt-Col Patterson shot them — Tsavo lies on the historic Nairobi–Mombasa route","when":"Jun-Oct + Jan-Feb","commission":"DMC/venue","wells":[],"wells_basis":"text supports no Well — needs a human read","si_all":["deepdive"],"shelf_fit":{"adventure":"destination","deepdive":"primary","romance":"destination","safari":"destination","ultra":"destination"},"commission_lane":["DMC","venue"],"commission_embedded":false,"commission_basis":"lane"},{"name":"A Finch Hattons / Kilaguni honeymoon","si_tag":"ultra","status":"live","tier":"premier","price_band":"~$400-1,500+/night all-in","timing":"standing; peak 2-5 mo","draw_rank":1,"hook":"Tsavo West''s grand lodges — Finch Hattons'' spring-fed luxury tents, Kilaguni Serena''s waterhole veranda under the Chyulu Hills — private, wild and quiet; honeymoon-grade","si":"ultra","blurb":"Tsavo West''s grand lodges — Finch Hattons'' spring-fed luxury tents, Kilaguni Serena''s waterhole veranda under the Chyulu Hills — private, wild and quiet; honeymoon-grade","when":"standing; peak 2-5 mo","commission":"consortia/Virtuoso + DMC","wells":["stay"],"wells_basis":"derived from name/blurb/hook","si_all":["romance","safari","ultra"],"shelf_fit":{"adventure":"destination","deepdive":"destination","romance":"evidenced","safari":"evidenced","ultra":"primary"},"commission_lane":["DMC","consortia"],"commission_embedded":false,"commission_basis":"lane"},{"name":"A Tsavo bush honeymoon","si_tag":"romance","status":"live","tier":"premier","price_band":"on application","timing":"Jun-Oct + Jan-Feb","draw_rank":1,"when_source":"derived from destination timing","timing_type":"SEASONAL-WINDOW","si":"romance","when":"Jun-Oct + Jan-Feb","commission":"consortia/host","wells":["stay"],"wells_basis":"pass 2 — text","si_all":["romance","safari"],"shelf_fit":{"adventure":"destination","deepdive":"destination","romance":"primary","safari":"evidenced","ultra":"destination"},"commission_lane":["consortia"],"commission_embedded":false,"commission_basis":"lane"}],"faq":[{"q":"What''s the real risk to plan for in Tsavo?","a":"Vastness and remoteness. At ~22,000 km2 of sparsely-roaded wilderness, a breakdown or emergency is far from help - travel with an experienced operator and carry AMREF Flying Doctors (~$40 pp/30 days) + travel-medical insurance. Dangerous game (lion, elephant, hippo and croc at Mzima) - stay in the vehicle and follow your guide.","source":"en.wikipedia.org","si_tag":"safety"},{"q":"Do I need the yellow-fever vaccine for Tsavo?","a":"Note the nuance: while YF is otherwise only mandatory arriving from a risk country, CDC specifically recommends the yellow-fever vaccine for Taita-Taveta County, which is Tsavo - so plan for YF as recommended for this park, plus malaria prophylaxis.","source":"cdc.gov","si_tag":"safety"},{"q":"When is the best time to visit Tsavo?","a":"Jun-Oct and Jan-Feb (dry) - bush thins, wildlife concentrates at water, and the red elephants and Mzima hippos are easiest to find. The green rains bring lush scenery, birdlife and lower rates.","source":"tsavonationalparkkenya.com","si_tag":"safari"},{"q":"Tsavo East or Tsavo West - which?","a":"Tsavo East is the classic - vast open plains and the red-elephant herds; Tsavo West is more varied - volcanic terrain, Mzima Springs, and Ngulia''s black rhino. Many itineraries do both, or pair Tsavo with Amboseli or the coast.","source":"safaritravelplus.com","si_tag":"safari"},{"q":"Do I need a visa for Kenya?","a":"An eTA (Kenya replaced visas with the eTA in 2024 - apply at least 2 weeks ahead; required for all visitors). Currency is the Kenyan shilling with M-Pesa everywhere, but safari is quoted in USD.","source":"en.wikipedia.org","si_tag":"safari"}],"seo":{"meta_title":"Tsavo Safari Guide: Red Elephants, Big Five (Ngulia Rhino), Mzima Springs & Best Time","meta_description":"Plan a Tsavo safari - Kenya''s largest, oldest and least-crowded big park: the famous red elephants, a full Big Five with black rhino at Ngulia, the underwater window of Mzima Springs, the legend of the Man-Eaters, better value than the Mara - with real safety (YF-recommended), timing and cost.","slug":"tsavo-kenya","primary_keyword":"Tsavo safari","long_tail":["Tsavo red elephants","Tsavo East vs West","Ngulia rhino sanctuary","Mzima Springs Tsavo","Man-Eaters of Tsavo","best time to visit Tsavo","is Tsavo safe"],"search_language":"sw","local_keywords":["Tsavo","tembo wekundu","Chemchem za Mzima","faru mweusi","simba wa Tsavo","Maporomoko ya Lugard"],"hreflang":["en","sw"],"jsonld_type":"TouristDestination","content_freshness":"2026-07-31","attribution":{"author":{"type":"Organization","name":"TravelWell.World"},"publisher":{"type":"Organization","name":"TravelWell.World LLC"},"reviewed_by":{"type":"Organization","name":"TravelWell.World"},"digital_source_type":"CompositeWithTrainedAlgorithmicMediaDigitalSource","digital_source_vocab":"https://schema.org/IPTCDigitalSourceEnumeration","last_verified":"2026-07-31","last_verified_basis":"source_verified","verified_against":[{"name":"UK Foreign, Commonwealth & Development Office","url":"https://www.gov.uk/foreign-travel-advice/kenya","read":"2026-08-20T14:53:50Z","source_updated":"2026-06-24T12:48:44+01:00"}]}},"booking":{"codes":["exercise-increased-caution","crime","urban-unrest"],"book_suppressed":false,"note":"safe licensed-operator safari. NOTE: CDC recommends yellow-fever vaccine for Taita-Taveta County (Tsavo). Re-verify each cycle.","advisory_updated":"2026-08-20","advisory_authority":"FCDO"},"si_checklist_25":{"run_date":"2026-07-31","hits":7,"misses":15,"disregarded":3,"note":"Canonical 25-SI list; SAFARI is the launch/demo SI - primary safari not globaladv; Mzima Springs/Lugard Falls/walks = globaladv; Man-Eaters/railway history = deepdive; Tsavo IS a Big Five park (Ngulia black rhino); sports limited to participant; spectator/prosports/compsports disregarded"},"sis_present":[{"si":"safari","name":"safari","status":"live","note":"red elephants + Big Five incl. black rhino (Ngulia)"},{"si":"ultra","name":"ultra","status":"live","note":"Finch Hattons / Kilaguni"},{"si":"romance","name":"Romance, Marriages & Honeymoons","status":"live"},{"si":"globaladv","name":"adventure","status":"live","note":"Mzima Springs underwater chamber, Lugard Falls"},{"si":"deepdive","name":"deepdive","status":"future","note":"the Man-Eaters of Tsavo / railway history"}],"ultra":[{"name":"Finch Hattons Luxury Tented Camp - Tsavo''s apex stay","why_ultra":"spring-fed colonial-glamour tents under the Chyulu Hills, spa + private guiding in a vast wilderness","earning":"consortia/Virtuoso","virtuoso_value_add":true,"mor":"commissionable-rack","tier":"ultra","price_band":"~$900-1,800+/night"},{"name":"A private Tsavo East + West + Ngulia-rhi